<title>UK: RATP sets 400 mln Danish crown December 2005 bond. [CORRECTED 16:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>RATP sets 400 mln Danish crown December 2005 bond. [CORRECTED 16:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REGIE AUTONOME DES TRANSPORTS PARISIENS</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    15.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.58    PAY DATE  S-15.APR.97</p>
<p>(Corrects issue price to 101.58 from 101.625.)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 YIELD	 5.77 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10-50     MGT/UND     1.625</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
